---
import SectionGlow from "./SectionGlow.astro";
import isotipo from "../assets/Financial isotipo.svg";
---

<section id="como-funciona" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-petrol/[0.05] py-24">
  <SectionGlow />
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-16 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start">
      <!-- Left: kicker + timeline -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-petrol">Proceso Ágil & 100% Digital</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-petrol sm:text-4xl">
          De la conversación informal al pago de la patente, en 3 pasos
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-12 space-y-12 border-l-2 border-petrol/25 pl-8">
          <div class="relative">
            <span
              class="absolute -left-12 top-0 grid h-8 w-8 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-emerald bg-white text-sm font-bold text-petrol"
              >01</span
            >
            <h3 class="font-bold text-petrol">Contacto sin fricción</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-petrol/90">
              El emprendedor escanea un QR en la web municipal, redes sociales o afiches vecinales y abre WhatsApp
              al instante, sin descargar apps.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="relative">
            <span
              class="absolute -left-12 top-0 grid h-8 w-8 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-teal bg-white text-sm font-bold text-petrol"
              >02</span
            >
            <h3 class="font-bold text-petrol">Diagnóstico y perfilamiento IA</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-petrol/90">
              La IA analiza el rubro, verifica zonificación preliminar (<abbr title="Dirección de Obras Municipales" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2">DOM</abbr>),
              determina si califica como <abbr title="Microempresa Familiar" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2">MEF</abbr>{' '}
              y genera el checklist exacto.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="relative">
            <span
              class="absolute -left-12 top-0 grid h-8 w-8 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-emerald bg-emerald text-sm font-bold text-petrol"
              >03</span
            >
            <h3 class="font-bold text-petrol">Trámite asistido en el SII</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-petrol/90">
              Acompañamiento guiado para la iniciación de actividades en el <abbr title="Servicio de Impuestos Internos" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2">SII</abbr>{' '}
              y obtención del <abbr title="RUT electrónico, para emitir boletas y facturas" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2">e-RUT</abbr>,
              listo para el pago de la patente municipal.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: WhatsApp phone mockup -->
      <div class="reveal flex justify-center lg:sticky lg:top-28 lg:justify-end">
        <div class="relative w-[320px] rounded-[2.5rem] border-8 border-petrol bg-petrol shadow-2xl">
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-petrol">
            <!-- Chat header -->
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-t-[2rem] bg-petrol px-4 py-3.5 text-white">
              <div class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full bg-white p-1.5">
                <img src={isotipo.src} alt="" width="24" height="24" class="h-full w-full" />
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1">
                <p class="text-base font-bold leading-tight">Financial</p>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-emerald">en línea</p>
              </div>
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="opacity-70" aria-hidden="true"
                ><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="1.6" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle
                  cx="12"
                  cy="12"
                  r="1.6"
                  fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="19" cy="12" r="1.6" fill="currentColor"
                ></circle></svg
              >
            </div>

            <!-- Chat body -->
            <div class="flex h-[420px] flex-col gap-3 overflow-y-auto bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--color-petrol)_5%,white)] px-3 py-4">
              <div class="chat-bubble-in max-w-[80%] bg-petrol/[0.08] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[13px] leading-snug text-petrol">
                Hola! Quiero vender empanadas los fines de semana desde mi casa, ¿necesito algo legal? 😅
                <div class="mt-1 text-right text-[10px] text-petrol">09:14</div>
              </div>

              <div
                class="chat-bubble-out ml-auto max-w-[80%] bg-emerald px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[13px] leading-snug text-petrol"
              >
                ¡Hola María! 👋 Soy el asistente virtual de tu Municipalidad. Cuéntame: ¿vendes solo los fines de
                semana o de forma habitual?
                <div class="mt-1 flex items-center justify-end gap-1 text-[10px] text-petrol">
                  09:14
                  <svg width="14" height="10" viewBox="0 0 16 11" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"
                    ><path
                      d="M1 5.5 4.5 9 11 1.5M5.5 9 12 1.5"
                      stroke="#024655"
                      stroke-width="1.4"
                      stroke-linecap="round"
                      stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg
                  >
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="chat-bubble-in max-w-[80%] bg-petrol/[0.08] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[13px] leading-snug text-petrol">
                Los fines de semana, en la feria costumbrista del barrio
                <div class="mt-1 text-right text-[10px] text-petrol">09:15</div>
              </div>

              <div
                class="chat-bubble-out ml-auto max-w-[80%] bg-emerald px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[13px] leading-snug text-petrol"
              >
                Perfecto, calificas como Microempresa Familiar (MEF) ✅. Te preparo el checklist para iniciar
                actividades en el SII. ¿Comenzamos?
                <div class="mt-1 flex items-center justify-end gap-1 text-[10px] text-petrol">
                  09:15
                  <svg width="14" height="10" viewBox="0 0 16 11" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"
                    ><path
                      d="M1 5.5 4.5 9 11 1.5M5.5 9 12 1.5"
                      stroke="#024655"
                      stroke-width="1.4"
                      stroke-linecap="round"
                      stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg
                  >
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="chat-bubble-in flex items-center gap-1 bg-petrol/[0.08] px-4 py-3">
                <span class="typing-dot h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-petrol/40"></span>
                <span class="typing-dot h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-petrol/40"></span>
                <span class="typing-dot h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-petrol/40"></span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
